+package dev.lelonio.square.ui.player
+
+/**
+ * Spots a well-known place in a line of lyrics, for the map card in
+ * [MessagesLyricsView].
+ *
+ * There is no network and no geocoder behind this: it is a short list of
+ * landmarks and big cities, matched as whole words. That keeps it instant and
+ * private, and it means a place that is not on the list simply gets no card.
+ * Names that are mostly somebody's name in a song (Paris, Austin, Jordan,
+ * Houston...) are left out on purpose, so a card is rarely wrong.
+ *
+ * Add a place by adding a `"what is sung" to "Name, Region"` pair below.
+ */
